；第8周治疗成功者进入44周长期安全延长期（双盲继续），主期未成功者按方案转入开放 rescue 路径","quote_sha256":"a3490646b4957a65288283bd9f3ccc4288b82e43d0b5fd9676bce237dde1bb99","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"ES003"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","quote":"随机化按年龄组（12~17 vs ≥18岁）、基线严重度（vIGA-AD 3 vs 4）与地区分层，2:1分配（芦可替尼:赋形剂）以扩大安全性暴露经验","quote_sha256":"0275dfeacad44a6d3ece98d98814c29d0d699d5ba01cf9f76e5ae9affdabce83","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"ES004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","quote":"筛选期（最长28天，含≥1周瘙痒日记与保湿稳定）；双盲主期（第1~8周）；长期安全延长期（第9~52周，主期治疗成功者）；安全性随访（末次用药后4周）","quote_sha256":"52f5c21b6c6594db932a6098826a8ff1238ad81328b5fae96a92a09a1a360d2b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"ES005"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ES001","ES002","ES003","ES004","ES005"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[],"heading":"研究设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心、随机、双盲、赋形剂对照、两臂平行组的III期确证性临床研究，旨在确证磷酸芦可替尼乳膏（1.5%，每日两次，单药外用）治疗≥12岁中重度特应性皮炎的疗效与安全性，支持国内外注册申报。研究设置独立数据监查委员会（DMC）对安全性数据进行定期审查。试验组接受磷酸芦可替尼乳膏1.5%每日两次薄涂于AD受累皮肤，对照组接受外观与气味一致的匹配赋形剂乳膏每日两次。随机化按年龄组（12~17岁与≥18岁）、基线严重度（vIGA-AD 3分与4分）及地区进行分层，采用2:1分配（芦可替尼组与赋形剂组）以扩大安全性暴露经验。研究时期包括筛选期（最长28天，含≥1周瘙痒日记与保湿稳定）、双盲主期（第1~8周）、长期安全延长期（第9~52周，仅限主期治疗成功者）及安全性随访（末次用药后4周）。全程不允许合并其他系统性和外用抗AD治疗，基础保湿剂标准化使用。","rationale":"本段依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的总体研究设计、试验干预、随机化方案、研究时期和DMC设置。需医学经理确认：（1）'赋形剂对照'与'安慰剂对照'表述是否统一；（2）2:1分配比例和分层因素是否经监管沟通确认；（3）DMC审查频率和触发标准。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_5802328cf94b_f929a9f98e563c12","section_number":"4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8960a2141cf77eeb9bc924d9","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2353d4130880b6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7450f8d809500d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:36b243eff81e8f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7ead478754a111"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261007135021_ecc0fa0b","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","quote":"随机、双盲、赋形剂对照、两臂平行组、多中心III期确证性研究","quote_sha256":"11ebe106e0cbf50b45cedd95baa975040cfb9d0d9bc55acb8427f43e6c4d6b1b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"ES001"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_5802328cf94b_69278d1f7aa982ed:full-draft:8960a2141cf77eeb9bc924d9","quote":"随机化；双盲；安慰剂对照；平行组；多中心；设置独立数据监查委员会（DMC）","quote_sha256":"6450935204c952de9a1386cd7302806bc0614ad879abfc9cd9bee935286169c3","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:8960a2141cf77eeb9bc924d9","span_id":"ES002"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","quote":"磷酸芦可替尼乳膏1.5%每日两次薄涂患处 vs 赋形剂乳膏每日两次，8周双盲主期；第8周治疗成功者进入44周长期安全延长期（双盲继续），主期未成功者按方案转入开放 rescue 路径","quote_sha256":"a3490646b4957a65288283bd9f3ccc4288b82e43d0b5fd9676bce237dde1bb99","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"ES003"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","quote":"随机化按年龄组（12~17 vs ≥18岁）、基线严重度（vIGA-AD 3 vs 4）与地区分层，2:1分配（芦可替尼:赋形剂）以扩大安全性暴露经验","quote_sha256":"0275dfeacad44a6d3ece98d98814c29d0d699d5ba01cf9f76e5ae9affdabce83","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"ES004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","quote":"筛选期（最长28天，含≥1周瘙痒日记与保湿稳定）；双盲主期（第1~8周）；长期安全延长期（第9~52周，主期治疗成功者）；安全性随访（末次用药后4周）","quote_sha256":"52f5c21b6c6594db932a6098826a8ff1238ad81328b5fae96a92a09a1a360d2b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"ES005"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ES001","ES002","ES003","ES004","ES005"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[],"heading":"总体设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究采用随机、双盲、赋形剂对照、两臂平行组、多中心设计，设置独立数据监查委员会（DMC）。试验组为磷酸芦可替尼乳膏1.5%每日两次薄涂患处，对照组为匹配赋形剂乳膏每日两次，外观与气味一致且不含活性成分。双盲主期持续8周，第8周治疗成功者进入44周长期安全延长期（双盲继续），主期未成功者按方案转入开放rescue路径。随机化按年龄组（12~17岁与≥18岁）、基线严重度（vIGA-AD 3分与4分）与地区分层，2:1分配（芦可替尼:赋形剂）以扩大安全性暴露经验。全程标准化基础保湿剂使用，不合并其他AD系统或外用治疗。","rationale":"本段依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的总体设计描述、试验干预与对照、随机化方案及研究时期划分。需医学经理确认：（1）rescue路径的具体方案（开放标签转换条件、后续治疗选择）；（2）延长期是否保持双盲还是转为开放；（3）DMC审查节点与安全性触发标准。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（总体设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_5802328cf94b_7f3ae808cae71156","section_number":"4.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8960a2141cf77eeb9bc924d9","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2353d4130880b6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7450f8d809500d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:36b243eff81e8f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7ead478754a111"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261007135021_ecc0fa0b","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","quote":"第8周vIGA-AD治疗成功（清晰或几乎清晰[0/1]且较基线下降≥2分）的受试者比例（磷酸芦可替尼乳膏 vs 赋形剂）","quote_sha256":"5f65b16741ac29735c2eaf9358638ed06a260a7035c32bad810fb612b687f04f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"ES006"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","quote":"假设赋形剂组第8周vIGA-AD成功率约18%、芦可替尼组约38%；按双侧α=0.05、2:1分配，单侧把握度90%计算约需850例（芦可替尼567/赋形剂283）；考虑15%脱落扩至1000例（约667/333）","quote_sha256":"27a66110ea5597ff20d78aa5e6d440351f44425d7e10c8e37abe78429c7e29d3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"ES007"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","quote":"确证性研究；确证磷酸芦可替尼乳膏（1.5%每日两次，单药外用）治疗≥12岁中重度特应性皮炎的疗效与安全性（8周主期），支持国内外注册申报；评估52周长期用药的安全性（含皮肤感染、皮肤癌变等局部免疫抑制相关风险）与疗效维持；评价瘙痒（峰值瘙痒NRS4应答）与生活质量的改善","quote_sha256":"612ba945d09ae4ad69a8b7fec65a842d0dbe298cf912eb3815cb99495556d19d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"ES008"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","quote":"外用JAK1/JAK2抑制剂：局部抑制JAK-STAT信号通路，降低I型/II型细胞因子受体信号传导，减轻AD的Th2型炎症与瘙痒；系统暴露极低（较口服低约90%）","quote_sha256":"4dd0ea93c790137e6de06d5eb405f94ea1ab938ceebafe4030f59f09f351f8ba","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","span_id":"ES009"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ES006","ES007","ES008","ES009"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[],"heading":"确证性设计与假设依据","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为III期确证性研究，其设计依据为：磷酸芦可替尼乳膏（ruxolitinib cream）为外用JAK1/JAK2抑制剂，通过局部抑制JAK-STAT信号通路、降低I型/II型细胞因子受体信号传导，减轻特应性皮炎的Th2型炎症与瘙痒；系统暴露极低（较口服低约90%），预期局部疗效与全身安全性风险可控。确证性设计采用双盲、赋形剂对照、两臂平行组，以第8周vIGA-AD治疗成功（清晰或几乎清晰[0/1]且较基线下降≥2分）的受试者比例作为主要终点，与赋形剂组比较。关键次要终点包括第8周EASI-75应答比例、第8周周均峰值瘙痒NRS4应答（较基线下降≥4分）比例及第8周EASI较基线百分比变化，按层级顺序控制I类错误。主要估计目标为治疗策略，在≥12岁中重度AD人群中，无论是否中止研究治疗或使用补救治疗，评价磷酸芦可替尼乳膏1.5%每日两次相较赋形剂对第8周vIGA-AD治疗成功比例的作用；主期未成功者按方案进入rescue并保留于主要分析集（mITT）。样本量假设赋形剂组第8周vIGA-AD成功率约18%、芦可替尼组约38%，按双侧α=0.05、2:1分配、单侧把握度90%计算约需850例，考虑15%脱落扩至1000例（约667/333），该样本量同时满足EASI-75与瘙痒NRS4应答的检验需求。","rationale":"本段依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的作用机制、主要终点、关键次要终点、估计目标策略和样本量策略。需医学经理确认：（1）主要终点vIGA-AD成功定义（0/1且下降≥2分）是否与既往注册路径一致；（2）关键次要终点的层级检验顺序；（3）样本量假设参数（18%/38%）的来源依据及是否需更新；（4）mITT中rescue受试者的处理是否符合ICH E9。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（确证性设计与假设依据）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、估计目标、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_5802328cf94b_b0f084389d43e75e","section_number":"4.2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8960a2141cf77eeb9bc924d9","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2353d4130880b6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7450f8d809500d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:36b243eff81e8f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7ead478754a111"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261007135021_ecc0fa0b","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"需补充本项目PK/PD采样时间窗、PK/PD终点定义、采样与疗效/安全性终点的关联逻辑及PK建模计划","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"GAP-005","missing_source_classes":["项目PK/PD研究设计文件","药代动力学方案章节"],"target":"4.2.2节PK/PD采集点设计依据"},{"action":"需补充支持外用芦可替尼乳膏局部PK特征和系统暴露极低（较口服低约90%）的既往研究或文献来源","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"GAP-006","missing_source_classes":["既往PK/PD研究数据","外用JAK抑制剂文献"],"target":"4.2.2节外用JAK抑制剂局部PK与系统暴露特征"}],"heading":"PK/PD采集点设计依据","missing_source_classes":["项目PK/PD研究设计文件","药代动力学/药效学方案章节","既往PK/PD研究数据","外用JAK抑制剂系统暴露与局部PK特征文献"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本项目当前来源未提供PK/PD采集点的具体设计依据。项目研究事实仅标注局部/系统暴露范围为local，未列出PK/PD采样时间窗、PK/PD终点定义、采样与疗效终点的关联逻辑或药代动力学建模计划。公司语料中MG-K10方案提及PK/PD/免疫原性血样采集，但该来源为不同药物（生物制剂）、不同设计（16周双盲期、单臂/开放标签概念验证），不可迁移至本项目外用小分子JAK抑制剂方案。MY004567方案摘要提及PK/PD特征评估，但为II期单臂开放标签篮式试验，设计维度不匹配。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_5802328cf94b_b1d6f22d3978c211","section_number":"4.2.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8960a2141cf77eeb9bc924d9","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2353d4130880b6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7450f8d809500d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:36b243eff81e8f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7ead478754a111"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"91c106ec5cd4b0560645b1d44bec25ac3cbadce8b6c6a42a62623305d63dae10","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_5802328cf94b_69278d1f7aa982ed:full-draft:8960a2141cf77eeb9bc924d9","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:8960a2141cf77eeb9bc924d9","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:eca54904aa60ef4f68b1c37a4766294930e81de8f140fb1e8b1422cf107bedcb:8960a2141cf77eeb9bc924d9","text_sha256":"91c106ec5cd4b0560645b1d44bec25ac3cbadce8b6c6a42a62623305d63dae10"},{"content_sha256":"7b015b09d69d17f2bd5c86427b2b72c8dcf92e459dd7cb4ac134a54864a378f1","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_b88e90fe0d39f0246cb9:r4:f0c046e418e0ae80","text_sha256":"7b015b09d69d17f2bd5c86427b2b72c8dcf92e459dd7cb4ac134a54864a378f1"},{"content_sha256":"b176d0c4639a4d6fb75987c64c3bf52d942c507fe6358d48747e12acb4534e9b","locator":"section:3.1 研究总体设计|block:455|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol